<title>USA: Costco March same-store sales rise 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Costco March same-store sales rise 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISSAQUAH, Wash. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $1,960     $1,740	 +13	  +11</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $12,660    $11,320	 +12	   +9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is 5 weeks ended April 6.</p>
<p>Full company name is Costco Cos Inc</p>
